#
# Implement useradd -K/--key KEY=VALUE (override /etc/login.defs defaults).
#
# Overrides are merged into the in-memory LoginDefs table so every later
# defs.get* / uid_range / gid_range call sees them, matching the man-page
# behavior of overriding login.defs defaults for the invocation.
#
